    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Black Light Kills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a town shaken by mysterious disappearances, Aiden finds himself on a nightmarish journey. Losing his grip on reality, he must face terrifying creatures and unravel mysterious events. The answers lie buried within horrifying secrets.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Different Endings Await You:\u00a0</strong>The story can lead to two different endings based on the events you experience throughout the gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blurred Storyline:</strong> Aiden's mental turmoil will draw you into a deep narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling Atmosphere:</strong> The quiet yet disturbing town will push you closer to the edge of madness with every step.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clues:</strong> Carefully examine every detail to uncover the town's dark secrets. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177550/extras/e63c3efc3a83d0beae9d02db1120af6f.poster.avif?t=1745231765\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177550/extras/e63c3efc3a83d0beae9d02db1120af6f.webm?t=1745231765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177550/extras/e63c3efc3a83d0beae9d02db1120af6f.mp4?t=1745231765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sensitivity to Mental Breakdown:</strong> Aiden's mental deterioration deepens with environmental changes, causing you to continuously question the nature of reality.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Sound and Visual Design:</strong> Atmospheric sound effects and dark visuals will ensure that tension and fear are at their peak with each step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension:</strong> Hidden dangers and mind games will lead Aiden to question his sanity.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177550/extras/21dd3cea4cd24540f3b30c7c3335fc21.poster.avif?t=1745231765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177550/extras/21dd3cea4cd24540f3b30c7c3335fc21.webm?t=1745231765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177550/extras/21dd3cea4cd24540f3b30c7c3335fc21.mp4?t=1745231765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Experiences:</strong> Expect to encounter disorienting events and hallucinatory visions that challenge your perception of reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Soundscapes:</strong> The game features meticulously crafted sound design that enhances the psychological horror experience, keeping you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loneliness and Isolation:</strong> The desolate corridors and abandoned rooms intensify feelings of solitude and isolation.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177550/extras/75b3c824f4825a73d52e94c549053df1.poster.avif?t=1745231765\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177550/extras/75b3c824f4825a73d52e94c549053df1.webm?t=1745231765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177550/extras/75b3c824f4825a73d52e94c549053df1.mp4?t=1745231765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><strong>FEAR IS ONLY OUTSIDE BUT ALSO LURKING WITHIN AIDEN'S MIND. ARE YOU READY FOR THIS JOURNEY?</strong></i></p></li></ul>",
